# The golden snapshots, the frozen baselines and the generated template compare byte-for-byte,
# so text files must be LF in every checkout (git's Windows default, core.autocrlf=true, would
# turn them into CRLF and fail ~26 tests).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
